.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-10T11:36:41Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T11:41:42Z","body":"> I just noticed that the triggers for the older GUID for your controller are mapped with `+`s in the godotcontrollerdb.txt mapping, while in SDL's internal mapping they are not. Maybe that's causing the problem? Maybe our Godot code can't map the triggers properly unless there are `+`s in the mapping?\r\n> \r\n> I will see what I can do.\r\n\r\nIn my PR I used this to solve a different problem; that shouldn't be necessary anymore.\r\n\r\nIssue #99191 (lefttrigger:+a4,righttrigger:+a5)\r\n> On Android, Controller Triggers once pressed, stay pressed until the game is restarted","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3877064039/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3877134084","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114338#issuecomment-3877134084","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114338","id":3877134084,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nGF8E","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch